invariant: INV-35
file: Makefile
catches: test/lib-check-webpki-record.sh
reason: PUBLIC stops naming ch_build, so the link localizes it and no
  consumer can read the record. lib-check's export list reads PUBLIC,
  so the object and the list still agree and the export check passes.
  The consumer lib-check links against the object then finds no
  ch_build to read and fails to link, so lib-check objects. The link
  stamp holds PUBLIC, so the object is linked again under the edited
  list rather than kept from the last run.

--- old
PUBLIC_BUILD := ch_build
--- new
PUBLIC_BUILD :=
